# Build output and dev-machine-specific signing material - regenerated
# locally from source, never shared across machines.
x64/
Debug/
Release/
*.sys
*.cer
*.pfx
*.pdb
*.obj
*.log
# Compiled test-harness binaries (e.g. ppid_spoof_test.exe) - rebuild from
# the committed .c source instead; same "never commit build output" policy
# as the driver binaries above.
*.exe
# Captured output from running a test harness (e.g.
# self_protect_test_output.txt) - a result of running the committed .c
# source, not source itself.
*_output.txt
*_err.txt
